As per final order, for the following;
REASONS 10. Issue No.1 : - In order to explain the actionable negligence of the driver of offending vehicle,
P.W.1 the father of minor petitioner has filed his affidavit explaining the vivid picture of the accident that took place on the stated date when the minor petitioner after alighting from the BMTC electric bus bearing Reg.No.KA-51-AH-4539 (hereinafter referred to as the offending vehicle) at TTMC bus stop, Bengaluru -Mysuru main road and was standing by the side of the road, at that time the driver of the bus by driving the vehicle in a rash and negligent manner dashed against the petitioner, due to the impact she stuck between the bus and the cement barrier, result of which she sustained grievous injuries.
